    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθροισμα</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is gathered, a
			gathering</i>, 
