				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					874
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				3.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
